msgid "TURBO AND EXTREM OVERCLOCK PRESETS MAY CAUSE SYSTEM UNSTABILITIES, SO USE THEM AT YOUR OWN RISK.\n"
"IF YOU CONTINUE, THE SYSTEM WILL REBOOT NOW."
